  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): same \"discovery counts diverge from emission counts; no closed-set check\" cluster as INV-jukok (23 dangling src IDs surface as 23-edges/0-nodes in metrics.by_supply_chain_tier `unknown` bucket). The 296-file gap here breaks down as INV-babuj (yaml 174) + INV-gosub (markdown 107) + 15 trailing — the per-language root causes are filed; the missing piece is the orchestrator-side reconciliation gate. WI-soraj intentionally splits total_files (profile) from unique_paths_in_analysis (emission); the consumer-facing field name doesn't disambiguate."  # 6b54
