- op: discuss  # e141
  at: '2026-06-06T10:36:49Z'  # e141
  by: agent  # e141
  actor: jgstern_agent  # e141
  clock: 13  # e141
  nonce: e141  # e141
  message: "Related distinct facet — the spec-identity violation behind the spread (blind-severity-derived priority signal: P1). metrics.total_files=916 equals the no-profile fallback (unique_paths_in_analysis), but spec §940 defines total_files = sum(profile.languages[L].files) = 1218. The map took the 'computed without a profile' fallback path (§946) DESPITE a populated profile being present — so total_files violates its own documented identity, understating the per-language sum by 302. Fix: correct the total_files computation path to use the profile sum when a profile is present. (Note: the undocumented 3rd metrics.debug key, profile_files_sum, was split out as its own work item — separate doc/remove fix.)"  # e141
